   280	
   281	- **Base models.** Understand Agent: Qwen3-VL [Author, arXiv:2511.21631] (native long video, frame timestamps); Generation Agent: FLUX.1-dev/Kontext-dev with OminiControl [arXiv:2411.15098], or Qwen-Image-Edit; detector: Grounding-DINO / APE [Video-RAG, arXiv:2411.13093]; embeddings: BGE-M3.
